1362
01:01:50,720 --> 01:01:53,480
you say it when it's really like, "Damn it!"

1363
01:01:53,480 --> 01:01:55,060
It's like you can use it in so many situations.

1364
01:01:55,060 --> 01:01:55,340
Right.

1365
01:01:55,340 --> 01:01:57,100
Watta-pa! Yeah, yeah, yeah, yeah.

1366
01:01:57,100 --> 01:01:58,240
Kind of like that.

1367
01:01:59,660 --> 01:02:03,060
That's how it felt.

1368
01:02:03,120 --> 01:02:07,140
Like, when it's great, or fun, or you use the F-word, yeah.

1369
01:02:07,140 --> 01:02:09,980
It was something like that.

1370
01:02:09,980 --> 01:02:12,660
It's risky, too.

1371
01:02:12,660 --> 01:02:18,940
So if you say something funky in front of elderly people, they might blow up at you.

1372
01:02:18,940 --> 01:02:21,420
Well, I'm not entirely sure.

1373
01:02:21,660 --> 01:02:26,520
I don't know for sure, but anyway, thank you!

1374
01:02:26,520 --> 01:02:28,580
Man, I just can't sit still, can I? Sorry about that.

1375
01:02:28,580 --> 01:02:31,440
Right, the reason I don't want to move my hands too much is...

1376
01:02:31,440 --> 01:02:33,380
I just can't stay quiet!

1377
01:02:33,380 --> 01:02:38,680
I mostly remember getting scolded during graduation.

1378
01:02:38,680 --> 01:02:40,040
They'd be like, "Don't move!"

1379
01:02:40,040 --> 01:02:44,800
Not like "Raise your right hand," but they always told me not to move.

1380
01:02:44,800 --> 01:02:47,240
Thank you everyone!

1381
01:02:47,240 --> 01:02:51,320
Oh, sorry, it's past 8:00. Thank you all so much for watching.

1382
01:02:51,320 --> 01:02:54,020
Thanks, that was fun.

1383
01:02:54,020 --> 01:02:56,160
I'll take these home with me.

1384
