See ya!

1387
01:03:03,780 --> 01:03:07,440
The Mandalorian series has been so popular lately.

1388
01:03:07,440 --> 01:03:08,740
I want to watch the show,

1389
01:03:08,740 --> 01:03:10,200
but I saw a tweet that said, "Why on earth do I have to watch Boba Fett?"

1390
01:03:10,200 --> 01:03:11,680
That's what the tweet said,

1391
01:03:11,680 --> 01:03:12,320
and I was like,

1392
01:03:12,320 --> 01:03:13,600
don't say that!

1393
01:03:13,600 --> 01:03:14,950
Boba Fett is fun too!

1394
01:03:14,950 --> 01:03:17,340
I'd be happy if you all grew to like it.

1395
01:03:17,340 --> 01:03:21,640
Thanks, everyone.

1396
01:03:30,060 --> 01:03:32,720


1397
